ng to secret_string_wo\",\n      \"body_excerpt\": \"1.11.0 5.89 Relates #47907 * aws_secretsmanager_secret_version Given that secret_string_wo is a write-only attribute, swapping from using secret_string to secret_string_wo on an existing resource should be a no-op: the resource exists and thus must have a value and from the point of view of a write-only attribute should be safe. Alternatively, removing from state and re-importing against config th\",\n      \"state\": \"closed\",\n      \"state_reason\": \"completed\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2025-03-03T15:30:04Z\",\n      \"score\": 0.274,\n      \"band\": \"weak\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"number\": 45218,\n      \"ref\": \"hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws#45218\",\n      \"title\": \"Support `secret_binary_wo` in `aws_secretsmanager_secret_version`\",\n      \"body_excerpt\": \"* Currently aws_secretsmanager_secret_version resource only support secret_string_wo variable for ephemeral version of secret_string. The resource should support secret_binary_wo variable for ephemeral version ofsecret_binary. * aws_secretsmanager_secret_version hcl resource \\\"aws_secretsmanager_secret_version\\\" \\\"example\\\" { secret_id = aws_secretsmanager_secret.example.id secret_binary_wo = filebase\",\n      \"state\": \"open\",\n      \"state_reason\": null,\n      \"created_at\": \"2025-11-22T11:57:13Z\",\n      \"score\": 0.25,\n      \"band\": \"weak\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"corpus_size\": 11653,\n  \"thresholds\": {\n    \"likely\": 0.4,\n    \"possible\": 0.28\n  }\n}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"73b35784-c45d-438c-85de-058a3e5d9f9b","uuid":"26ee0ce3-ad40-49de-9837-941755c20f74","timestamp":"2026-10-28T17:39:32.804Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"{\n  \"issue\": {\n    \"number\": 23,\n    \"title\": \"resource/aws_secretsmanager_secret_version: `secret_string_wo_version` documented as Optional but enforced as required when `secret_string_wo` is set\",\n    \"author_association\": \"NONE\",\n    